  "title": "Publix Expands Frozen Berry Recall After E. Coli Outbreak Sickens 12",
  "summary": "Food safety remains a top priority for consumers, and the latest recall involving Publix GreenWise frozen berries has raised fresh concerns across several U.S. states. The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) has expanded a previous recall to include all GreenWise Organic Whole Blueberries and Whole Mixed Berries after an investigation linked the products to an E. coli outbreak that has sickened 12 people. The recall affects multiple package sizes and products distributed across eight states",
